  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.45,
      401.95,
      278.27
    ],
    "text": "6. (1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any General Meeting of the members and by amajority of not less than two thirds of the members presentto make rules, not inconsistent with the provisions of thisAct or any other written law, on all or any of the followingmatters:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      292.25,
      401.88,
      316.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)the classification of members, and the admission,withdrawal, resign, expulsion of members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      330.41,
      401.89,
      367.19
    ],
    "text": "(b)the election of office bearers, the resignation from,vacation of or removal from office bearers and theirpowers, conduct and duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      381.17,
      401.88,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "(c)the election of the members of the Committees ofthe Management and its powers, conduct duties andterm of the committee members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
