      316.49,
      397.2,
      384.83
    ],
    "text": "8.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allmonyes heretofore or hereafter to be received by way ofgifts, bequest, donation, subscription, contribution, fees orgrants for and on account of the corporation shall be depositedto the credit of the Corporation in one or more banks as theCommittee of Management shall determine.",
