    "text": "(2) There shall be paid out of the Fund, all sums of moneyrequired to defray any expenditure incurred by theCorporation in the exercise, performance and discharge ofits powers, duties and functions under this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
